 dependencies.
+
+With XRender enabled, static images are uploaded once and reused for zooming
+and panning. Anti-aliasing stays enabled during interaction; filtered smaller
+versions are cached as needed for zooming out. Initial uploads and the first
+visit to a smaller resolution can take longer. Interpolation may differ from
+Imlib2's software renderer. Animated images, images over 48 megapixels or
+32767 pixels on either side, unavailable XRender support, and allocation
+failures use the software renderer. To select software rendering at runtime,
+launch with `NSXIV_NO_XRENDER=1 nsxiv ...`.
 
